<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/2nd-century-bce">2nd century BCE</a></p><h1 class="research-title">168 BCE</h1><p class="ref-lede">168 BCE in world history: 5 events and 1 state that came to an end. 338 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
